  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/664/664-22.htm",
  "statuteText": "664:22 Notice to Candidates. –\n\nThe secretary of state shall give or send by mail a copy of this chapter to each person whose name will be printed on a state primary or general election ballot. Such notification shall be given or sent within 5 days of the close of the filing period."
